{"title":"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5(fakesolve)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5(fakesolve)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7_(log_rules)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7 (log rules)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Solution_8_(Exponential_Form)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 8 (Exponential Form)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Short_and_Easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Short and Easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_&amp;_More_by_MegaMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution &amp; More by MegaMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_By_MathTutorZhengFrSG\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution By MathTutorZhengFrSG</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There exist real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, both greater than 1, such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/0/b00ba57d66f11bcd019e0474ebfeb18a570919f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x\\left(y^x\\right)=\\log_y\\left(x^{4y}\\right)=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"211\" height=\"24\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By properties of logarithms, we can simplify the given equation to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84e5de8ae0e319eb55ee6d4ed5a707862d2a608c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\log_xy=4y\\log_yx=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"193\" height=\"21\" />. Let us break this into two separate equations: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d55c9dfcfd873669a80886d55187f19f3611bda.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x\\log_xy=10\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/0/5b01c64bb4d5b4ad25159305ab5d97d2a56bc564.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4y\\log_yx=10.\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"19\" />\nWe multiply the two equations to get: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433f42f4fda44557d99bd60f5db220c4e0682a93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4xy\\left(\\log_xy\\log_yx\\right)=100.\\]\" width=\"195\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p>Also by properties of logarithms, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/f/4df90cd0524dba0d44bbf4f4c8e2754e4dbe2fca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_ab\\cdot\\log_ba=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"19\" />; thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/0/a8021ca69172863eea6fb8046f27479f97c23c92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_xy\\cdot\\log_yx=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"138\" height=\"21\" />. Therefore, our equation simplifies to: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/8/968ba9e7f231134a15dd1b22aca223a5d5d3947c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4xy=100\\implies xy=\\boxed{025}.\\]\" width=\"216\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~Technodoggo\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Convert the two equations into exponents:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2af4ec313d2cf6f52c0893f418be33bd47d8bd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{10}=y^x~(1)\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/29142adda91dae7f81e9e988e12d5b0380e60fb4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^{10}=x^{4y}~(2).\\]\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> to the power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a0901419c277658469226431138dfb5ede474b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"37\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/9/3095267bc5f7c2f59735b250a03277b63b994697.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{\\frac{10}{x}}=y.\\]\" width=\"63\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Plug this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/6/1d6fb0629c4d87e36efa435c6628275423711151.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{(\\frac{10}{x})(10)}=x^{4(x^{\\frac{10}{x}})}\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a250ac7a3cdf8769d70835b33c4c0cbda19e19dc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[{\\frac{100}{x}}={4x^{\\frac{10}{x}}}\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/563826c31e726fe406ecfa632e6635f3ee945c42.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[{\\frac{25}{x}}={x^{\\frac{10}{x}}}=y,\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/e/2ae76f639d48f494a4b2bd182f5e7c0af38f69cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy=\\boxed{025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"85\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~alexanderruan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Similar to solution 2, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10b1e2e70b6bd95d323047b0ce4605d0b82e2d25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{10}=y^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/4/a047bd8965a391006bbee3bbe40bc7308d2e49db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{10}=x^{4y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Take the tenth root of the first equation to get \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c55c2d6e983bbd13313cc46fa81e29dc687f52e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y^{\\frac{x}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"21\" /> \n</p><p>Substitute into the second equation to get \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9695ec607e561ab7f67447e5e944a2f393bacee3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{10}=y^{\\frac{4xy}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/f/7ff9cfc6942aeb5824a3d13a5331fbf9a58158ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10=\\frac{4xy}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"77\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1cec0b55b59935253fb0e3bb27cca947c60db6f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100=4xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" />, meaning that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/e/2ae76f639d48f494a4b2bd182f5e7c0af38f69cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy=\\boxed{025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"85\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~MC413551\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The same with other solutions, we have obtained <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10b1e2e70b6bd95d323047b0ce4605d0b82e2d25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{10}=y^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/4/a047bd8965a391006bbee3bbe40bc7308d2e49db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{10}=x^{4y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/0/730b9b0e0f0d3e6917649beaba6cac71de4b4133.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{10}y^{10}=y^xx^{4y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" />. So, an obvious solution is to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b65107e6389b7365f7b9efda37153c1b3f2bc94d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{10}=x^{4y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaaa1cc6f0f11d79152d15e360faedc2bc252ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{10}=y^{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />. Solving, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec186fd1809357d1f530bee2334ceb59d405b4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/f/9cf93643d66b00e6ac489e35ecf1e29c83df230a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" />.So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/4/8c4bcca534d765d160c7045e0cae005fbf08ca2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = \\boxed{025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"85\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>Note: This is not a correct solution. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec186fd1809357d1f530bee2334ceb59d405b4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/f/9cf93643d66b00e6ac489e35ecf1e29c83df230a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> does not satisfy the equations.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5.28fakesolve.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5(fakesolve)\">Solution 5(fakesolve)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5(fakesolve)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the first expression, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e296933b5bbc1c82434a82a681a28596c65cdae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{10} = y^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />. Now, taking the log of both sides, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/f/85f4eb1b3f3eba4451b6227f3dfb7fc8aa2fd811.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_y(x^{10}) = \\log_y(y^x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"160\" height=\"23\" />. This simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/5/8e5a8f8aa5c42da2334ffddc5e9c93996ff34ad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\log_y(x) = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"114\" height=\"22\" />. This is still equal to the second equation in the problem statement, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/0/9504b07212df8adb3622c198c3e911d62d19be82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\log_y(x) = x = 4y \\log_y(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"216\" height=\"22\" />. Dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/5/1a53a0eb51b958a99ec1a9ae0a128f34bc151336.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_y(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"58\" height=\"22\" /> on both sides, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/3/5e3f3ec17a9e24fba6bdf17c2f05e29e3822e7e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4y = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce07f44aade9496a90bf9ffa973f2152fcee4d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db01bbbcff09f012ee82195a0599062bed351b93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/4/8c4bcca534d765d160c7045e0cae005fbf08ca2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = \\boxed{025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"85\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~idk12345678\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b982ce4230c5d3e64718b3ccad7ee0a502ea0e60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y=x^a\\]\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" />.We see: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/b/99bd43f0e9d779d02fdec22969a1b896471b452a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ax=10\\]\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/1/a516191da2398ce5ec94daedacd8ec0bd6fe6fca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4x^a/a=10\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" />\nwhich gives rise to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77fb3571f887c75976cb579ab2f22af17ad782bc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xy = \\boxed{025}\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~Grammaticus\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_7_.28log_rules.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7_(log_rules)\">Solution 7 (log rules)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7 (log rules)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Split into 2 equations to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/7/4a7c2648111bde90c9099da5a547cf921394ed23.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_x\\left(y^x\\right)=10\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/3/993a5bd1394a9f8f1133476ecd9a3b902af3e23b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_y\\left(x^{4y}\\right)=10\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"22\" />\nNow use the logarithm power rule and the change of base rule to obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/6381cb0f7447a80374c99d3d4731238d9a9bc7cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x\\cdot\\frac{\\log y}{\\log x}=10\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"41\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/f/4effd1add57929df829c3c71b327195fdc8a61d5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4y\\cdot\\frac{\\log x}{\\log y}=10\\]\" width=\"114\" height=\"41\" /> Multiplying both equations to cancel <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7dfc10dcbc5b23e7c667b2cdbea104715ff654a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/5/df56be8e08b3c20bccc978bd5d9c97959c1dcd44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f35a8cf3e51d4a382f8e980700f53cdaa876c25.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4xy = 100\\]\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77fb3571f887c75976cb579ab2f22af17ad782bc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xy = \\boxed{025}\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~Abirgh\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_8_.28Exponential_Form.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_8_(Exponential_Form)\">Solution 8 (Exponential Form)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 8 (Exponential Form)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can convert the equality chain into two equations in exponential form, which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a5ee1f526e456e8397dd4a6acb1f84626938f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{10} = y^{x}\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c1088f1ae740af76876726d82ec821784ed7e2c5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^{10} = x^{4y}\\]\" width=\"71\" height=\"19\" />\nTo obtain an equation which involves exponents of only one variable, we can raise to first equation to power of 10, and raise the second equation to the power of x, which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/9/0a9f27b10d8a35e5d4d7831dca7e865de46cccab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{100} = y^{10x}\\]\" width=\"84\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab5e84424e06d21fb2f7764ab054813e5d71ef0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{4xy} = y^{10x}\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"19\" /> Now we can deduce that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfb81e485e51419f7d62f5500fd121687dc43669.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{4xy} = x^{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" />, which must mean that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e816d56082f691e1a24abb1b6003bcb27d54c085.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4xy = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" /> and the desired value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77fb3571f887c75976cb579ab2f22af17ad782bc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xy = \\boxed{025}\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~BlazeSai2\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Short_and_Easy.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Short_and_Easy)\">Video Solution (Short and Easy)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Short and Easy)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/N3pfeAzxIKA\">https://youtu.be/N3pfeAzxIKA</a>\n</p><p>~ Veer Mahajan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qLUahGcewT4\">https://youtu.be/qLUahGcewT4</a>\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5wHEa9Qwe3k\">https://youtu.be/5wHEa9Qwe3k</a>\n~Ajeet Dubey (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.ioqm.in\">https://www.ioqm.in</a>)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.26_More_by_MegaMath\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_&amp;_More_by_MegaMath\">Video Solution &amp; More by MegaMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution &amp; More by MegaMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jxY7BBe-4gU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jxY7BBe-4gU</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_By_MathTutorZhengFrSG\">Video Solution By MathTutorZhengFrSG</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution By MathTutorZhengFrSG\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HbGlIki_BsY\">https://youtu.be/HbGlIki_BsY</a>\n</p><p>~MathTutorZhengFrSG\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I\" title=\"2024 AIME I\">2024 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2024 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2024\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=